stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INPUT_PENDING
    INPUT_PENDING --> INPUT_REVIEW: drawing + idea recorded
    INPUT_REVIEW --> SUBJECT_REVIEW: VLM result validated
    SUBJECT_REVIEW --> ACTIVITY_REVIEW: Parent confirms subject
    ACTIVITY_REVIEW --> SCRIPT_REVIEW: Parent confirms activity
    SUBJECT_REVIEW --> SCRIPT_REVIEW: Teacher plan/activity already approved
    SCRIPT_REVIEW --> STORYBOARD_REVIEW: script schema valid
    STORYBOARD_REVIEW --> VIDEO_QUEUED: adult approves exact storyboard hash
    VIDEO_QUEUED --> VIDEO_GENERATING: worker accepted
    VIDEO_GENERATING --> FINAL_REVIEW: scenes + TTS + composition ready
    VIDEO_GENERATING --> RETRYABLE_FAILURE: bounded transient failure
    RETRYABLE_FAILURE --> VIDEO_QUEUED: retry policy allows
    VIDEO_GENERATING --> BLOCKED_REVIEW: safety/consistency check needs adult
    BLOCKED_REVIEW --> VIDEO_QUEUED: adult approves retry
    FINAL_REVIEW --> APPROVED: adult approves final hash
    FINAL_REVIEW --> VIDEO_QUEUED: request scene redo
    FINAL_REVIEW --> REJECTED: adult rejects final output
    INPUT_PENDING --> CANCELLED: adult cancels
    INPUT_REVIEW --> CANCELLED: adult cancels
    SCRIPT_REVIEW --> FAILED: non-retryable schema/provider error
    RETRYABLE_FAILURE --> FAILED: attempts exhausted
    APPROVED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]